{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>RefoMeasure 專為 DIY 愛好者與小型裝修工程而設，把房間尺寸與產品包裝規格轉化為實際的材料用量估算，由量度房間到整理購物清單都可一手包辦。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合準備自行鋪地板、貼牆紙或安裝石膏板的用家。</p>\n\n<h2>四種材料計算器</h2>\n<p>RefoMeasure 內置四種計算器，分別處理牆紙、地板、石膏板及膠地板。輸入房間尺寸與包裝規格，即得出所需捲長、包數或板材數量，並加入購物清單。同一產品的規格可重複使用，計算記錄與明細一目瞭然，更能合併多個房間或項目，匯出 PDF 與 CSV 清單。應用無需帳戶，不含廣告，資料只留在裝置。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-772-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-773-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-774-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-775-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-776-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：RefoMeasure: Renovation Calc</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T14:20:22.300405+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":338,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}